    "LongDescription": "Radhuni Cumin Powder is a finely ground spice made from high-quality cumin seeds, known as\"jira\"in South Asia. It is a staple in Bangladeshi, Indian, and Middle Eastern cuisines, offering a warm, earthy flavor with a hint of citrus. This 200 gm pack is perfect for households, providing a convenient and flavorful addition to your spice collection.\r\n\r\nIngredients: Pure Cumin Seeds: Ground to a fine powder.\r\nNote: Always check the packaging for any potential additives or allergens.\r\n\r\nBenefits:\r\nAids Digestion: Cumin is known for its carminative properties, which help reduce bloating and improve digestion.\r\nRich in Nutrients: Contains iron, calcium, and magnesium, supporting overall health.\r\nBoosts Immunity: Packed with antioxidants that help strengthen the immune system.\r\nEnhances Flavor: Its unique aroma and taste elevate any dish it’s added to, making it a versatile kitchen essential.",
